>DEFY THE CYCLE OF DEATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fall is only the start of another run. Resurrection brings deeper secrets and the chance to twist fate itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/9f879af77b52bf793c6b8f2c0bf98fdc.poster.avif?t=1761037094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/9f879af77b52bf793c6b8f2c0bf98fdc.webm?t=1761037094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/9f879af77b52bf793c6b8f2c0bf98fdc.mp4?t=1761037094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERIC WORLDS AND DYNAMIC BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a realm forged by divine fire and demonic corruption. A visually rich world awaits with balanced design, unique characters, vibrant colors, and vivid effects that bring every battle to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["LINE Games Corporation"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/3f51532b553a00a378b1a70858b5a6b42033c040/header.jpg?t=1761037094","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>\u00a9 LINE Games Corporation. All rights reserved.</strong>","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6th gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970 / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\